  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:152px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Pincers.png\" title=\"Fire Mutant Pincers\"><img alt=\"Fire Mutant Pincers\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"100\" src=\"/images/recovered/Pincers.png\" width=\"150\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/recovered/Pincers.png\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Fire Mutant Pincers</div></div></div>\n<p><b>Race:</b> Mutants\n</p><p><b>Class:</b> Fodder\n</p><p>Pincers are small spider like creatures who usually come in large groups. \n</p><p><b>Tip:</b> <i>They are not very bothersome if you have a good <a href=\"/wiki/AoE\" title=\"AoE\">AoE</a> spell which will wipe them out in big lots.  As with other small swarming creatures Fighters can get frustrated targeting them one at a time.  Their Heroes and Champions are vexing for all classes because they jump around a lot and it is hard to get a bead on them!</i>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Basic_Types\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Basic Types</span></h2>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name\n</th><th>Element\n</th><th>Habitat\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Searing Pincer\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Tainted_Grove\" title=\"Tainted Grove\">Tainted Grove</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Overlord's_Sepulcher\" title=\"Overlord's Sepulcher\">Overlord's Sepulcher</a>,<a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Forest\" title=\"Dark Forest\">Dark Forest</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fire Mutant Pincer\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Algor's_Terror_Dome\" title=\"Algor's Terror Dome\">Algor's Terror Dome</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Toxic Mutant Pincer\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Widower's_Nest\" title=\"Widower's Nest\">Widower's Nest</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Xhelduh's_Hideout\" title=\"Xhelduh's Hideout\">Xhelduh's Hideout</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Poison Mutant Pincer\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Frump's_Misfortune\" title=\"Frump's Misfortune\">Frump's Misfortune</a>, Level 3, <a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">The Shadow's Embrace</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shadow Pincer\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Vexation\" title=\"Vergrim's Vexation\">Vergrim's Vexation</a>,The <a href=\"/wiki/Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"Mutanous Malaise\">Mutanous Malaise</a> Mezzanine, level 5 - 7\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lava Pincer\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td>Lower <a href=\"/wiki/Ratsputin's_Gulag\" title=\"Ratsputin's Gulag\">Ratsputin's Gulag</a> offs\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
